<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11177"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Icyou<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Icyou<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 10, 2005 - 1:23 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hmmm...I don&#39;t remember hearing about this woman...but I would have only been 12 in &#39;86.  Anyway, FAlun is either in Saline County or McPherson county...at any rate it is very close to Salina.  I&#39;m inclined to think Falun is McPherson co.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
