<!--Post: 11197--><!--Time: 1110496779-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11197"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 10, 2005 - 3:19 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->this is one of the cases in the Saline cold case files, that we have been working on, trying to ID her. I do not believe she was from Kansas<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11197-->
<!--Post: 11404--><!--Time: 1110674544-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11404"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 12, 2005 - 4:42 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Looked everywhere in Kanas files couldn&#39;t come up with missing person to fit this MO, well found a couple possibles from outside Kansas, have sent info to Smith in Saline, and still looking into this case.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
